    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 104px\"><th id=\"1662574278R149\" style=\"height: 104px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 104px\">150</div></th><td class=\"s17\">Mulligan</td><td class=\"s25\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:104px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaDj6aJPYNKS5GrZhZZZ-9pSTTOF7mNPfvd6axbENcpXZYdAenYZBG5HLID1JHLhk6hO9kn5-lvkjzqEh_LYog0FADMWQfWfhskpZblggBIIdaUD7iK2KLJDwDYldJ-qjDjdKPzV8Xlt1toQB8hGCgINS-8lgcbXe81=w70-h104\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s19\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">On </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Miss</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">:<br></span><span style=\"color:#999999;\">Primary Weapons</span> have a 35% <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑40%</span> chance to generate 1 Ammo.<br><span style=\"color:#93c47d;\">Special Weapons</span> and <span style=\"color:#a481e1;\">Power Weapons</span><span style=\"color:#b4a7d6;\"> </span>have a 20% <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑25%?</span> chance to generate 1 Ammo.<br><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑Primary Weapons have a 40%? chance to generate ammo. <br>Special Weapons and Power Weapons have a 25%? chance to generate ammo.</span></td></tr>",
    "text": "150   Mulligan        On   Miss  :   Primary Weapons  have a 35%  ↑40%  chance to generate 1 Ammo.  Special Weapons  and  Power Weapons    have a 20%  ↑25%?  chance to generate 1 Ammo.     ↑Primary Weapons have a 40%? chance to generate ammo.  Special Weapons and Power Weapons have a 25%? chance to generate ammo."
  },
