  "enhancedExcluded": true,
  "mapping": "Only actually paid supported hitscan emissions with no eligible living-entity geometry contact may roll once after all pellets. A wall contact counts as a miss; an eligible entity contact counts as a hit even when damage is rejected. Actual generated loaded reward is capped at base magazine capacity, not a reload or reserve transfer. Uniform integer percentile RNG is local sampling policy. Source owner/stack/roll validity is checked before grant; duplicate tokens are consumed without reroll."
